---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="404 - 页面未找到 - shidatizi.co"
  description="抱歉，您访问的页面不存在或已被移除。请返回首页或查阅我们的机场推荐、排行榜与使用教程。"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "404 未找到" }]}
>
  <div class="py-20 bg-slate-50 min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center">
    <div class="max-w-lg mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <div class="text-7xl font-black text-blue-600 mb-4 tracking-tighter">404</div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3">
        抱歉，该页面无法访问
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        您所请求的链接可能已失效、被重定向或已迁移至最新技术架构。请尝试通过以下推荐入口继续浏览：
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-8 text-xs font-bold">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 text-white hover:bg-blue-700 shadow-md transition-all"
        >
          返回网站首页
        </a>
        <a
          href="/ranking/overall/"
          class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white text-slate-800 border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-all"
        >
          查阅综合排行榜
        </a>
        <a
          href="/recommend/budget/"
          class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white text-slate-800 border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-all"
        >
          便宜低预算推荐
        </a>
        <a
          href="/guides/"
          class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white text-slate-800 border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-all"
        >
          客户端使用教程
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
